# Canonical Turtle for the protocol-derived encoding of:
#   Niklas Leimeroth et al. (2025). Machine-learning interatomic potentials from a users perspective: a comparison of accuracy, speed and data efficiency.
#   Modelling and Simulation in Materials Science and Engineering. doi:10.1088/1361-651x/adf56d  arXiv:2505.02503v1
#
# Version read: arxiv-preprint arXiv:2505.02503v1 (sha256 3b5f4813f88b0746...);
#   the DOI above is cited, numbers are those of the version read.
# Corpus rank 54 (Overview/taxonomy). Method identity follows
#   artifacts/kg/METHODS.md (registry: artifacts/kg/methods-registry.csv).
#
# Encoding scope: the comparison set-up: HDNNP, GAP, MTP, linear and
# nonlinear ACE, NequIP, Allegro and MACE potentials fitted to the same
# Si-O and Al-Cu-Zr DFT data sets, with the shared cutoffs. One run per
# potential type and system stands for the family of fits the paper
# makes. Accuracy, speed, data efficiency and extrapolation are reported
# as figures, so no AccuracyMetric is encoded. The manifest files the
# paper under 'Overview/taxonomy'; it is an original benchmark. Read from
# the arXiv preprint (v1).

@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix schema: <https://schema.org/> .
@prefix mls: <http://www.w3.org/ns/mls#> .
@prefix unit: <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/> .
@prefix mlips: <https://w3id.org/mlips#> .
@prefix entity: <https://w3id.org/mlips/entity/> .

###############################################################################
# Q1 -- Bibliographic identification
###############################################################################

entity:study-leimeroth2025 a mlips:BenchmarkStudy ;
    rdfs:label "Leimeroth et al. (2025): MLIPs from a user's perspective, a comparison of accuracy, speed and data efficiency" ;
    mlips:reportedIn entity:article-leimeroth2025 .

entity:article-leimeroth2025 a schema:ScholarlyArticle ;
    schema:sameAs <https://doi.org/10.1088/1361-651x/adf56d> ;
    schema:datePublished "2025"^^xsd:gYear ;
    schema:name "Machine-learning interatomic potentials from a users perspective: a comparison of accuracy, speed and data efficiency" ;
    schema:author <https://orcid.org/0009-0005-3906-4751> ,
        <https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0219-5801> ,
        <https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4669-8056> ,
        <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4492-3371> .

<https://orcid.org/0009-0005-3906-4751> a schema:Person ;
    schema:name "Niklas Leimeroth" ;
    schema:givenName "Niklas" ;
    schema:familyName "Leimeroth" ;
    schema:identifier <https://orcid.org/0009-0005-3906-4751> .

<https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0219-5801> a schema:Person ;
    schema:name "Linus C Erhard" ;
    schema:givenName "Linus C" ;
